WEBVTT

00:01.060 --> 00:03.730
All right! I'm ready to have fun!

00:04.120 --> 00:05.290
Yes!

00:14.300 --> 00:16.180
What? You have a problem?

00:16.600 --> 00:19.410
We'll be in the alpha class after the break.

00:19.410 --> 00:21.670
That's why we've got to play right now!

00:24.610 --> 00:28.160
I'm sure we'll be busier than we are now.

00:29.020 --> 00:31.330
So I'm not doing anything 
that can be done tomorrow!

00:31.330 --> 00:32.950
O-Okay.

00:34.420 --> 00:38.870
Desir, let's play together!

00:41.820 --> 00:43.830
Desir!

00:45.760 --> 00:47.040
Okay.

00:47.040 --> 00:49.380
We'll enjoy ourselves a little today.

00:50.140 --> 00:52.670
Yes!

00:50.140 --> 00:52.670
Good!

00:55.540 --> 00:56.400
Yay!

00:56.400 --> 00:57.720
I guess it's fine.

00:57.720 --> 00:59.220
Desir!

01:00.770 --> 01:02.630
Hurry up and join us!

01:02.980 --> 01:03.980
Okay.

01:20.810 --> 01:27.980
<i>Fate is always more heroic than any story</i>

01:30.350 --> 01:37.130
<i>The one and only despair flaunts 
a completely different sky</i>

01:37.130 --> 01:39.700
<i>A stolen smile</i>

01:39.700 --> 01:49.080
<i>Put a period on the nights 
of lament and depression</i>

01:49.080 --> 01:53.710
<i>When the season comes around 
for the second time, gear yourself up</i>

01:53.710 --> 01:58.130
<i>For the final challenge</i>

01:58.130 --> 02:01.560
<i>Why don't we struggle, cry, and bloom away?</i>

02:01.560 --> 02:07.760
<i>I have a future, a future I want to 
go back to no matter what it takes</i>

02:07.760 --> 02:11.100
<i>Here we go and embrace 
the next life, nice to meet you</i>

02:11.100 --> 02:18.150
<i>There's a world, a world 
I want to repaint with you</i>

02:18.150 --> 02:20.480
<i>Let's go see the end together</i>

02:20.480 --> 02:23.120
<i>The ending credits signal the beginning</i>

02:23.120 --> 02:27.960
<i>A special story drawn by light and shadow</i>

02:27.960 --> 02:30.290
<i>Ge ge ge ge ge get back</i>

02:30.290 --> 02:32.920
<i>To my own story</i>

02:37.300 --> 02:41.470
<b></b>Episode 10

02:37.300 --> 02:41.470
<b>  Respite</b>

03:08.530 --> 03:09.920
You look great in all of them.

03:10.280 --> 03:12.640
Is that all you have to say?!

03:12.640 --> 03:16.050
Can't you tell me something 
that gets me hyped?!

03:16.890 --> 03:19.510
Hyped, you say?

03:20.450 --> 03:21.970
Time for take two!

03:28.840 --> 03:29.770
What do you think?

03:30.190 --> 03:32.780
Wow! That looks amazing!

03:32.780 --> 03:35.800
Yes, that's what I'm talking about.

03:35.800 --> 03:36.900
It looks great on you...

03:36.900 --> 03:38.150
Y-You think so—

03:38.150 --> 03:38.890
...Pram!

03:38.890 --> 03:39.990
Huh?

03:42.990 --> 03:44.320
Thank you!

03:44.320 --> 03:46.360
You meant about him?!

03:49.940 --> 03:51.140
Man...

03:58.490 --> 04:01.800
This one... no, maybe this one.

04:02.660 --> 04:04.780
Hey, are we done yet?

04:04.780 --> 04:06.320
Please don't talk to me!

04:06.320 --> 04:07.920
It's distracting!

04:07.920 --> 04:09.140
Sorry.

04:09.540 --> 04:12.850
Blue colors fit Desir's intellectual image,

04:12.850 --> 04:17.320
but shades of red totally fit 
his hidden strength and passion!

04:18.300 --> 04:22.590
But we can't forget orange,
 which shows his kindness and generosity...

04:22.590 --> 04:26.390
Oh! Actually pink might work best?!

04:30.340 --> 04:32.380
<i>Help me, Romantica!</i>

04:35.590 --> 04:36.310
<i>I can't.</i>

04:36.310 --> 04:37.820
No, maybe this one's better?

04:37.820 --> 04:39.630
<i>Don't give up on me!</i>

04:40.200 --> 04:41.960
But this one's also good...

04:40.200 --> 04:43.800
<i>No one can stop him when he's like this.</i>

04:44.400 --> 04:46.270
<i>I know...</i>

04:47.050 --> 04:49.780
<i>But this posture is bad for my back!</i>

04:50.320 --> 04:51.690
Please do not move!

04:51.690 --> 04:52.500
Okay!

04:55.270 --> 04:57.540
This! Or this?!

05:01.570 --> 05:03.610
We found the perfect tie for you, didn't we?

05:03.610 --> 05:06.910
Yes... Thank you for choosing it for me.

05:09.730 --> 05:15.120
He took more time shopping than I did.

05:15.120 --> 05:20.380
Pram looks happy, so all is good.

05:21.690 --> 05:23.410
You're right.

05:23.410 --> 05:26.600
Oh! Let's go there next!

05:26.600 --> 05:27.810
Great idea!

05:27.810 --> 05:29.380
Let's go!

05:32.180 --> 05:34.220
Those two are full of energy...

05:35.190 --> 05:36.620
Desir Herrman?

05:38.340 --> 05:39.660
Azest.

05:40.630 --> 05:42.380
I didn't know you were here.

05:43.060 --> 05:45.190
You think I'm out of place here?

05:45.860 --> 05:47.640
I wouldn't say that.

05:49.190 --> 05:51.550
I like a change of pace 
every now and then, too.

05:54.500 --> 05:57.940
Azest, listen...

06:02.690 --> 06:04.760
Do you... want to join?

06:09.790 --> 06:11.240
Me? Join you?

06:11.240 --> 06:12.180
Sure.

06:14.230 --> 06:19.580
Very well. I wouldn't mind a rematch 
for the ranking tournament.

06:20.150 --> 06:22.820
No, no, no, nothing serious like that.

06:22.820 --> 06:24.550
It's just play.

06:24.550 --> 06:25.820
I'm kidding.

06:29.300 --> 06:32.080
<i>Spare me! It's impossible to tell.</i>

06:32.520 --> 06:34.050
Sh-Shall we go?

06:34.050 --> 06:34.900
Sure.

07:02.050 --> 07:03.810
Wow, that's impressive!

07:04.660 --> 07:06.110
I got one!

07:12.880 --> 07:14.700
Why is she here?!

07:14.700 --> 07:17.540
Why is she standing next to Desir?!

07:19.650 --> 07:23.110
Come on, it doesn't hurt 
to hang out together.

07:36.460 --> 07:37.790
Is this better?

07:40.720 --> 07:43.060
Azest, let's play together!

07:43.060 --> 07:43.810
Huh?!

07:43.810 --> 07:45.670
Pram, you betrayed me!

07:45.670 --> 07:47.020
It's not like that.

07:47.020 --> 07:49.290
You traitor!

07:50.020 --> 07:51.640
How about that one?

07:58.310 --> 08:01.170
I wanted to be with Desir!

08:01.840 --> 08:04.260
We'll play the next game together.

08:05.670 --> 08:07.420
This isn't funny!

08:19.890 --> 08:20.960
Romantica.

08:21.410 --> 08:22.980
Wh-What is it?

08:24.130 --> 08:27.440
We're playing the academy's 
top-class swordsman and magic knight.

08:28.210 --> 08:30.940
You let your guard down, and you're done.

08:30.940 --> 08:33.220
I know that.

08:38.470 --> 08:40.800
I'm going to finish this game in a flash

08:40.800 --> 08:43.080
so I can pair up with 
Desir in the next game!

08:43.850 --> 08:45.300
Here I go!

08:58.350 --> 08:59.530
<i>So fast!</i>

09:03.400 --> 09:04.700
<i>There's no opening!</i>

09:05.320 --> 09:06.500
Romantica!

09:24.360 --> 09:27.390
Going up against me in air hockey,
 of all things...

09:28.910 --> 09:31.430
I'll teach you your place.

09:31.760 --> 09:33.680
Hold on, it's not fair to use magic.

09:35.080 --> 09:37.390
I see. I understand.

09:37.390 --> 09:38.720
Understand what?!

09:41.290 --> 09:43.850
It's our turn next.

09:47.190 --> 09:48.470
It's pointless!

09:55.620 --> 09:56.530
Wha...?!

10:00.980 --> 10:02.370
Are you kidding me?!

10:02.730 --> 10:04.930
You're amazing, Azest!

10:07.190 --> 10:10.550
<i>That's right, she hates losing...</i>

10:11.440 --> 10:14.060
This is getting interesting.

10:14.060 --> 10:15.560
Let's go!

10:20.820 --> 10:22.430
Not yet!

10:22.430 --> 10:24.390
There!

10:34.390 --> 10:36.040
Yes!

10:41.360 --> 10:42.610
Desir!

10:56.560 --> 10:57.550
Nice!

10:57.890 --> 11:00.210
You're amazing, Desir!

11:01.270 --> 11:03.480
Finally, you're putting your back into it.

11:05.490 --> 11:08.100
The game begins now!

11:13.590 --> 11:15.830
Thank you for hanging out with us.

11:15.830 --> 11:19.070
No, I should be the one to thank you.

11:19.070 --> 11:21.150
It was a nice change of pace.

11:25.760 --> 11:29.330
Well, I don't believe we'll see her again!

11:29.330 --> 11:30.820
What are you talking about?

11:30.820 --> 11:31.480
Huh?

11:31.890 --> 11:35.170
She's going to train with us, remember.

11:35.170 --> 11:39.800
And we'll be in the alpha class, 
so we'll see each other at the academy.

11:43.880 --> 11:46.660
I forgot!

12:03.870 --> 12:06.340
Wow, so this is the alpha class.

12:06.340 --> 12:09.160
It's a huge step up from the beta class.

12:09.590 --> 12:11.980
Look what I got.

12:14.450 --> 12:18.050
It's a world of difference.
It's almost refreshing.

12:18.390 --> 12:19.750
Whatever.

12:19.750 --> 12:22.500
We worked hard to be here.

12:22.500 --> 12:24.060
Right, Pram?

12:24.980 --> 12:27.030
Good to see that you're motivated.

12:27.350 --> 12:30.290
Then let's head off to our morning practice.

12:32.560 --> 12:34.600
Even though we're in alpha class, 
we're gonna keep doing this, huh?

14:20.600 --> 14:25.510
You identify each person's strength 
and adjust the training accordingly...

14:25.890 --> 14:27.470
Let's continue this after school.

14:27.470 --> 14:28.550
Yes.

14:35.370 --> 14:38.370
Romantica, the class is about to begin.

14:38.880 --> 14:42.690
Can't you... go a bit easy in the morning?

14:43.950 --> 14:45.370
We don't have much time left.

14:47.590 --> 14:49.660
What you told us the other day...

14:49.660 --> 14:50.870
Were you serious about it?

14:51.400 --> 14:53.510
The next battle will be a real fight.

14:54.200 --> 14:56.630
If anything goes wrong we could die,

14:58.040 --> 15:00.340
so I need you two to be stronger.

15:01.320 --> 15:02.820
I know it'll be tough, but...

15:04.350 --> 15:06.630
I believe in you, Desir.

15:08.100 --> 15:11.430
I don't doubt you either, at this point.

15:12.310 --> 15:13.970
Let's do this.

15:23.130 --> 15:28.590
The battle between humanity 
and the Shadow Worlds still continues.

15:30.080 --> 15:37.990
This disaster that repeats every year 
continues tainting our world.

15:39.790 --> 15:46.270
Because of this erosion, our continent 
is now half of what it used to be.

15:47.270 --> 15:53.810
Currently, though, the success rate of 
clearing the Shadow Worlds is 99.9%.

15:54.840 --> 15:58.100
We've been able to halt 
the contamination from the Shadow Worlds

15:59.650 --> 16:04.850
thanks to the power of the magic gems.

16:10.270 --> 16:16.390
Magic gems are the crystallized mana that 
appear when you clear a Shadow World.

16:17.270 --> 16:21.400
They contain an incredible amount of mana,

16:21.920 --> 16:25.830
but you cannot use it as-is.

16:27.680 --> 16:29.850
Fifty years ago,

16:30.770 --> 16:34.260
the technology to process and use
 the power of the magic gems

16:34.260 --> 16:36.260
was invented in the magical tower.

16:38.480 --> 16:40.180
As a result,

16:40.180 --> 16:44.160
the great wealth of mana that
 the magic gems produce

16:44.160 --> 16:47.690
has given rise to many things.

16:49.940 --> 16:54.680
Now, this technology to use magic gems...

16:55.720 --> 16:58.330
Who was it invented by?

16:59.820 --> 17:02.370
Let me see...

17:04.450 --> 17:05.800
You there!

17:06.900 --> 17:10.860
The one with red ribbons, nodding away.

17:13.050 --> 17:14.930
Y-Yes?! Yes!

17:17.750 --> 17:19.310
Do you know the answer?

17:22.290 --> 17:23.930
Um...

17:24.360 --> 17:27.110
The master of the magical tower,
 Zod Exarion.

17:28.300 --> 17:32.560
It was the master of the magical tower, 
Zod Exarion!

17:35.280 --> 17:36.990
That is correct.

17:39.840 --> 17:42.280
You've got to pay attention to the lecture.

17:42.280 --> 17:45.380
It's because you made me strain myself 
during morning practice!

17:48.740 --> 17:52.140
Well then, that is all for today's class.

17:53.490 --> 17:56.180
Thank you, everyone.

18:04.380 --> 18:05.700
Professor Prelude.

18:09.030 --> 18:10.550
You are...?

18:11.920 --> 18:13.540
I'm Desir Herrman.

18:14.460 --> 18:19.080
Ah, you're the one who became 
a single ranker in the ranking tournament.

18:19.960 --> 18:24.000
So are you, sleepy head.

18:24.000 --> 18:27.880
Huh?! Uh, I'm sorry...

18:31.460 --> 18:34.260
And how can I help you?

18:35.220 --> 18:38.220
I'd like to ask you a favor, 
Professor Prelude.

18:39.320 --> 18:42.690
A favor, you say?

18:48.090 --> 18:50.100
And what is this favor?

18:51.500 --> 18:56.280
You want support for your party?

18:57.640 --> 19:00.420
It's true that each party is eligible

19:00.420 --> 19:04.070
to receive support from the academy 
and the magical tower,

19:05.140 --> 19:09.020
but unfortunately the deadline has passed...

19:09.940 --> 19:11.720
No, That's not it.

19:16.140 --> 19:18.340
This is what we'd like to ask you.

19:20.280 --> 19:23.690
A request form?

19:25.320 --> 19:28.940
The protection detail for the 
magical tower's Heurelli branch?

19:30.220 --> 19:35.110
I understand that Hebrion Academy 
can assign a party to fill a request.

19:35.940 --> 19:38.140
Yes, that is true.

19:38.870 --> 19:42.670
I'd like you to put in 
that request for our party.

19:44.370 --> 19:45.650
But...

19:46.040 --> 19:47.270
Please.

19:55.380 --> 19:57.900
Unfortunately, I can't.

19:59.090 --> 20:01.510
To begin with, I don't have a reason to.

20:01.960 --> 20:03.820
What brought this up?

20:05.990 --> 20:11.150
A magical stone called the Tear of Regernel 
is stored at Heurelli branch, isn't it?

20:17.450 --> 20:19.070
How do you know that?

20:20.800 --> 20:25.540
In ten hours, 
some people are going to try to steal it.

20:27.380 --> 20:28.550
Don't tell me...

20:30.090 --> 20:31.460
The Outers.

20:34.620 --> 20:41.120
The Tear of Regernel, and the existence of 
the Outers, who are after the magic gems...

20:43.790 --> 20:47.170
You were in the beta class 
just a few days ago.

20:47.170 --> 20:49.140
How do you know all this?

20:49.700 --> 20:52.630
I don't have time to discuss that right now.

20:53.570 --> 20:58.400
What matters is that if we don't do something, 
the magic gems will be stolen.

21:03.490 --> 21:07.340
Professor Prelude, please put 
in the request for our party.

21:07.940 --> 21:10.670
Only you can do this.

21:17.260 --> 21:21.260
10 Hours Later    In the City-State of Alteia

21:21.380 --> 21:25.010
Magical Tower Headquarters

21:25.140 --> 21:28.020
Magical Tower Annex

21:37.680 --> 21:39.400
M-Master Zod!

21:39.850 --> 21:42.250
W-We have a problem!

21:42.250 --> 21:44.370
Heurelli branch is under attack!

21:46.000 --> 21:47.850
They really are here, huh?

22:01.380 --> 22:02.810
Who are you?

22:05.720 --> 22:08.470
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

22:08.470 --> 22:11.180
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

22:11.180 --> 22:14.790
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

22:19.270 --> 22:24.680
<i>All emotions will fade away sooner or later</i>

22:24.680 --> 22:29.280
<i>So we can pretend it's all a fairytale</i>

22:30.030 --> 22:35.400
<i>Even love is just a fleeting dream</i>

22:35.400 --> 22:39.830
<i>So let's throw the dice 
and see what's in store</i>

22:40.180 --> 22:46.350
<i>I rolled a six today, eight times in a row</i>

22:46.350 --> 22:51.610
<i>But who knows what 
tomorrow's play will bring?</i>

22:51.610 --> 22:56.640
<i>I hope one day we'll be able to say</i>

22:56.640 --> 23:00.850
<i>That not knowing was the best part</i>

23:02.360 --> 23:05.130
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

23:05.130 --> 23:07.820
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

23:07.820 --> 23:11.330
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

23:13.200 --> 23:16.040
<i>If we happen to meet again in the next life</i>

23:16.040 --> 23:18.620
<i>I'll take any help I can get, 
even my own cat's</i>

23:18.620 --> 23:21.330
<i>Because this time</i>

23:21.330 --> 23:25.460
<i>I'll roll a three</i>

23:35.480 --> 23:39.980
<b></b>Episode 11

23:35.480 --> 23:39.980
<b>  A Raid</b>

23:36.270 --> 23:39.080
Next episode, "A Raid."
